# ntdll: Add support for partial-FP context flags.
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/12587 state=merged
# Those flags allow addressing lower and higher part of FP registers. This is needed to implement YMM context on ARM64EC by storing XMM registers in v0..15 and YMM highs in v16..v31.
